join detective right
detective (thinking): I suspect that garlic might have something to do with Dracula’s murder.
join gardener left
gardener: Garlic?
detective (speaking): He collapsed after eating something. I'm thinking his food could have been laced with garlic.
gardener: We don’t keep any garlic in the house!
gardener: I ain’t even allowed to grow anything halfway related to garlic!
gardener: Though I s’pose there could be some hidden somewhere…
gardener (antsy): …
gardener: There’s a secret cabinet in the kitchen.
gardener (speaking) : It’s awfully well hidden. I doubt even a detective like you could’ve found it on a first sweep through the house.
gardener: I'll let you in on the secret.
[style name="dialogue_style"]
The gardener gives you instructions on how to find the hidden cabinet in the kitchen.
gardener: Go on, talk to [COOK] about it. I'm sure she'll be amused.
